# Cross-platform line ending normalization
#
# Markdown files (skills, prompts, AGENTS.md, docs) are stored with LF endings
# in the repository. Multiple contract tests compare canonical sources against
# their plugin mirrors via strictEqual, which fails on Windows when
# `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites checked-out files to CRLF.
#
# `text eol=lf` instructs git to:
# - Normalize CRLF to LF on commit
# - Check out as LF regardless of core.autocrlf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary assets (kept out of any text conversion path)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
